PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: media widget with a YouTube client and unknown position.
Why (measured): Firefox MPRIS sends mpris:length / Position only while a position state exists; the same video sent Metadata 8 times
without a length in 16 s -> the panel showed 0:00 / 0:00.
- posKnown === false: no fast clock, position '—:—', no thumb. Position text and bar painted from one place.
- ±10 s buttons (only when canSeek), queue / next / ad fields when the agent provides them; POST /api/media/skip?ms=±N.

